  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Row 0 and column 0 hold BAR LENGTHS: interior cell (r,c) turns cyan(8)\n ;; when BOTH its row bar reaches it (g[r][0] >= c) and its column bar does\n ;; (g[0][c] >= r); the headers themselves clear.\n (grid-from-fn h w (lambda (r c)\n   (if (or (= r 0) (= c 0)) 0\n       (if (and (>= (at g r 0) c) (>= (at g 0 c) r)) 8 0)))))",
